ta-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"hidden md:block object-cover object-center opacity-75\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fdep.jpe&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fdep.jpe&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fdep.jpe&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fdep.jpe&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fdep.jpe&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fdep.jpe&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fdep.jpe&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fdep.jpe&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fdep.jpe&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/><img alt=\"Academic Library Backdrop Mobile\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"block md:hidden object-cover object-center opacity-75\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fdep-mobile.jpe&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fdep-mobile.jpe&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fdep-mobile.jpe&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fdep-mobile.jpe&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fdep-mobile.jpe&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fdep-mobile.jpe&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fdep-mobile.jpe&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fdep-mobile.jpe&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fdep-mobile.jpe&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-linear-to-r from-slate-950/90 via-slate-950/65 to-slate-950/20\"></div></div><div class=\"relative z-10 max-w-5xl mx-auto px-8 sm:px-12 md:px-16\"><nav class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-amber-300 mb-6 font-medium tracking-wide\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><a class=\"hover:underline transition-colors\" href=\"/\">Home</a><span>&gt;</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><a class=\"hover:underline transition-colors\" href=\"/departments\">ACADEMIC DEPARTMENTS</a></div></nav><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-4\"><span class=\"w-8 h-0.5 bg-amber-500\"></span><span class=\"text-amber-400 text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase\">ACADEMIC DIVISIONS &amp; RESEARCH</span></div><h1 class=\"text-3xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl font-serif font-light text-white leading-tight max-w-3xl mb-6 drop-shadow-sm\">Six departments, one scholarly programme.</h1><p class=\"text-slate-200 text-sm sm:text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed max-w-2xl font-light mb-8 drop-shadow-sm\">Each department maintains its own research units, teaching staff and publication pipeline while contributing to the Institute&#x27;s shared agenda.</p><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-emerald-700 hover:bg-emerald-600 text-white text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium px-6 py-3.5 rounded-full transition shadow-lg\" href=\"#departments-list\"><span>Explore Departments</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right w-4 h-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div></section><section id=\"departments-list\" class=\"py-16 md:py-24 w-full mx-auto px-6\"><div class=\"mb-14\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><span class=\"w-6 h-0.5 bg-emerald-700\"></span><span class=\"text-emerald-800 text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase\">DEPARTMENTS</span></div><h2 class=\"text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-serif text-slate-800 mb-3\">Departments and research units</h2><p class=\"text-slate-600 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed max-w-3xl\">Departments are data-driven: new departments and units can be added without altering the site structure.</p></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6 sm:gap-8\"><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-7 sm:p-8 border border-slate-200/90 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col justify-between\"><div><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-6\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-800 text-xs font-semibold\">01</span><span class=\"text-[10px] sm:text-xs font-semibold tracking-wider text-amber-700/90 uppercase\">IRITAQ ACADEMICS</span></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-serif font-medium text-slate-800 mb-3\">Department of Tafsir</h3><p class=\"text-slate-600 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6\">Exegetical traditions, hermeneutics and interpretive authority. Advancing scholarship in classical commentary lineages.</p><div class=\"mb-8\"><h4 class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-wider text-slate-500 uppercase mb-3\">RESEARCH UNITS:</h4><ul class=\"space-y-2\"><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-600 shrink-0\"></span><span>Classical Tafsir</span></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-600 shrink-0\"></span><span>Modern Tafsir</span></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-600 shrink-0\"></span><span>Comparative Exegesis</span></li></ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"group inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium text-emerald-800 hover:text-emerald-950 transition-colors cursor-pointer w-fit\"><span>Learn More</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right w-3.5 h-3.5 group-hover:translate-x-0.5 transition-transform\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></button></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-7 sm:p-8 border border-slate-200/90 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col justify-between\"><div><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-6\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-800 text-xs font-semibold\">02</span><span class=\"text-[10px] sm:text-xs font-semibold tracking-wider text-amber-700/90 uppercase\">IRITAQ ACADEMICS</span></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-serif font-medium text-slate-800 mb-3\">Department of Qur&#x27;anic Sciences</h3><p class=\"text-slate-600 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6\">Transmission sciences, qira&#x27;at, rasm and textual history. Digging deep into foundational disciplines of revelation.</p><div class=\"mb-8\"><h4 class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-wider text-slate-500 uppercase mb-3\">RESEARCH UNITS:</h4><ul class=\"space-y-2\"><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-600 shrink-0\"></span><span>Qira&#x27;at Studies</span></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-600 shrink-0\"></span><span>Rasm &amp; Orthography</span></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-600 shrink-0\"></span><span>Asbab al-Nuzul</span></li></ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"group inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium text-emerald-800 hover:text-emerald-950 transition-colors cursor-pointer w-fit\"><span>Learn More</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right w-3.5 h-3.5 group-hover:translate-x-0.5 transition-transform\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></button></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-7 sm:p-8 border border-slate-200/90 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col justify-between\"><div><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-6\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-800 text-xs font-semibold\">03</span><span class=\"text-[10px] sm:text-xs font-semibold tracking-wider text-amber-700/90 uppercase\">IRITAQ ACADEMICS</span></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-serif font-medium text-slate-800 mb-3\">Department of Manuscripts</h3><p class=\"text-slate-600 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6\">Codicology, cataloguing, conservation and critical editions. Preserving rare classical folios with scientific rigour.</p><div class=\"mb-8\"><h4 class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-wider text-slate-500 uppercase mb-3\">RESEARCH UNITS:</h4><ul class=\"space-y-2\"><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-600 shrink-0\"></span><span>Codicology Studies</span></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-600 shrink-0\"></span><span>Digital Preservation</span></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-600 shrink-0\"></span><span>Critical Editions</span></li></ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"group inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium text-emerald-800 hover:text-emerald-950 transition-colors cursor-pointer w-fit\"><span>Learn More</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right w-3.5 h-3.5 group-hover:translate-x-0.5 transition-transform\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></button></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-7 sm:p-8 border border-slate-200/90 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col justify-between\"><div><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-6\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-800 text-xs font-semibold\">04</span><span class=\"text-[10px] sm:text-xs font-semibold tracking-wider text-amber-700/90 uppercase\">IRITAQ ACADEMICS</span></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-serif font-medium text-slate-800 mb-3\">Department of Translation Studies</h3><p class=\"text-slate-600 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6\">Translation theory, review and multilingual publication. Rendering authoritative scholarship accessible globally.</p><div class=\"mb-8\"><h4 class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-wider text-slate-500 uppercase mb-3\">RESEARCH UNITS:</h4><ul class=\"space-y-2\"><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-600 shrink-0\"></span><span>Translation Review</span></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-600 shrink-0\"></span><span>Terminology Standards</span></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-600 shrink-0\"></span><span>Multilingual Publishing</span></li></ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"group inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium text-emerald-800 hover:text-emerald-950 transition-colors cursor-pointer w-fit\"><span>Learn More</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right w-3.5 h-3.5 group-hover:translate-x-0.5 transition-transform\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></button></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-7 sm:p-8 border border-slate-200/90 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col justify-between\"><div><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-6\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-800 text-xs font-semibold\">05</span><span class=\"text-[10px] sm:text-xs font-semibold tracking-wider text-amber-700/90 uppercase\">IRITAQ ACADEMICS</span></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-serif font-medium text-slate-800 mb-3\">Department of Qur&#x27;an &amp; Society</h3><p class=\"text-slate-600 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6\">Ethics, law, economics and contemporary application. Fostering understanding of Qur&#x27;anic relevance in modern spaces.</p><div class=\"mb-8\"><h4 class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-wider text-slate-500 uppercase mb-3\">RESEARCH UNITS:</h4><ul class=\"space-y-2\"><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-600 shrink-0\"></span><span>Ethics &amp; Law</span></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-600 shrink-0\"></span><span>Society &amp; Culture</span></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-600 shrink-0\"></span><span>Science &amp; Qur&#x27;an</span></li></ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"group inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium text-emerald-800 hover:text-emerald-950 transition-colors cursor-pointer w-fit\"><span>Learn More</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right w-3.5 h-3.5 group-hover:translate-x-0.5 transition-transform\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></button></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-7 sm:p-8 border border-slate-200/90 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col justify-between\"><div><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-6\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-800 text-xs font-semibold\">06</span><span class=\"text-[10px] sm:text-xs font-semibold tracking-wider text-amber-700/90 uppercase\">IRITAQ ACADEMICS</span></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-serif font-medium text-slate-800 mb-3\">Department of Digital Humanities</h3><p class=\"text-slate-600 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6\">Corpora, annotation standards and computational analysis. Bridging historical texts with modern technology.</p><div class=\"mb-8\"><h4 class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-wider text-slate-500 uppercase mb-3\">RESEARCH UNITS:</h4><ul class=\"space-y-2\"><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-600 shrink-0\"></span><span>Corpus Building</span></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-600 shrink-0\"></span><span>Semantic Annotation</span></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-600 shrink-0\"></span><span>Data &amp; Analytical Tools</span></li></ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"group inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium text-emerald-800 hover:text-emerald-950 transition-colors cursor-pointer w-fit\"><span>Learn More</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right w-3.5 h-3.5 group-hover:translate-x-0.5 transition-transform\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></button></div></div></section><section class=\"py-12 px-4 sm:px-4 lg:px-4\"><div class=\"w-full mx-auto bg-[#f8f6f0] rounded-2xl sm:rounded-3xl p-10 sm:p-14 md:p-16 border border-amber-200/60 shadow-sm text-center flex flex-col items-center\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-center gap-2 mb-4\"><span class=\"w-6 h-0.5 bg-amber-600\"></span><span class=\"text-amber-800 text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase\">STUDY WITH US</span><span class=\"w-6 h-0.5 bg-amber-600\"></span></div><h2 class=\"text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl font-serif font-light text-slate-800 mb-8 max-w-2xl\">Programmes are offered through the departments</h2><a class=\"bg-emerald-800 hover:bg-emerald-900 text-white text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium px-7 py-3.5 rounded-full inline-flex items-center gap-2 transition shadow-md\" href=\"/academic-programs\"><span>View Academic Programmes</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right w-4 h-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></section></main><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"w-full bg-[#111613] text-[#cfd4cf] font-sans border-t border-[#1e2520]\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl m